      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.24 (up from ₹1.37 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.81b (up 9.0% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹205.9m (up 63% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (up from 7.6% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 22% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
